<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Dear {{{Case.First_Name__c}}}
<p>Thank you for contacting us regarding your recent booking.</p>

<p>We confirm that your booking (<strong>Booking Reference)</strong>&nbsp;has been voluntarily cancelled.</p>

<p>Please note that the airfare purchased was non-refundable for change of mind under the fare rules, and as such, no refund can be issued for the airfare and applicable GST by Qantas. However, the relevant airport taxes and surcharges have been refunded to your original form of payment method.</p>

<p>To assist with your travel insurance claim, we have prepared the following details:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Passenger Name(s): [Insert Names]</li>
	<li>Booking Reference: [Insert Reference]</li>
	<li>Ticket Number(s): [Insert Ticket Numbers]</li>
	<li>Original Travel Dates: [Insert Dates]</li>
	<li>Cancellation Date: [Insert Date]</li>
	<li>Fare Type: Non-refundable for change of mind</li>
</ul>

<p>If your insurer requires additional information, please let us know and we will be happy to assist.</p>

<p>We appreciate you’re understanding and hope to welcome you on board in the future.</p>

<p>Kind regards,</p>
<!--EndFragment --><!--StartFragment -->

<p>[Your Name]</p>

<p>Qantas Customer Care</p>
<!--EndFragment --></body>
</html>